            </note>
            <note corresp="#d263-f2" n="2" xml:id="d263-f2-content">
                <p>December 10.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d263-f3" n="3" xml:id="d263-f3-content">
                <p>The President was scheduled to be in San Clemente to prepare for the Summit with
                    Prime Minister Sato.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
